    "GeometryNodeInputSceneTime — supplies current frame for temperature schedule and random seed",
    "FunctionNodeCompare(LESS_THAN) — random < acceptance → flip boolean",
    "GeometryNodeSwitch(FLOAT) — conditional: keep or flip spin",
    "GeometryNodeStoreNamedAttribute(FLOAT, FACE) — writes updated spin back to geometry"
